{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2187", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2187/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2187/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2187/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2187", "id": 2009995690, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s53zhmq", "number": 2187, "title": "MavlinkPassthrough  subscription handles are not unique", "user": {"login": "c-devine", "id": 28029119, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDI5MTE5", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28029119?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine", "html_url": "https://github.com/c-devine", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977267, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNjc=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/bug", "name": "bug", "color": "ee0701", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 6, "created_at": "2023-11-24T16:53:38Z", "updated_at": "2024-05-20T04:16:58Z", "closed_at": "2024-05-20T04:16:58Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "When subscribing to MavlinkPassthrough messages, the returned MessageHandle is not unique.  This causes problems when unsubscribing.  The handle's _id does increment when subscribing a second time to the same message, but starts at 1 for each message id.\r\n\r\nAn example is shown below.  If you unsubscribe to handle2, both message subscriptions are unsubscribed (they both have _id = 1). \r\n\r\n```\r\nauto passthrough = MavlinkPassthrough{system.value()};\r\n\r\nauto handle1 = passthrough.subscribe_message(MAVLINK_MSG_ID_HOME_POSITION,[](mavlink_message_t message) {\r\n        std::cout << \"message1 : \" << message.msgid << std::endl;\r\n    });\r\n\r\nauto handle2 = passthrough.subscribe_message(MAVLINK_MSG_ID_HEARTBEAT,[](mavlink_message_t message) {\r\n        std::cout << \"message2 : \" << message.msgid << std::endl;\r\n    });\r\n\r\npassthrough.unsubscribe_message(handle2);\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2187/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2187/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1826406851", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2187#issuecomment-1826406851", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2187", "id": 1826406851, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5s3MHD", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2023-11-25T19:44:01Z", "updated_at": "2023-11-25T19:44:01Z", "body": "Oh, that doesn't look right. Thanks for reporting.\r\n\r\nThe subscription happens here: \r\nhttps://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/9a6416b5981d46d08c3ecd2332f460156628e6e0/src/mavsdk/plugins/mavlink_passthrough/mavlink_passthrough_impl.cpp#L200-L205\r\nthen:\r\nhttps://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/9a6416b5981d46d08c3ecd2332f460156628e6e0/src/mavsdk/core/system_impl.cpp#L99-L103\r\n\r\nIf I understand this right, we need to also pass the message ID when unsubscribing. It's not pretty but it would solve the problem, right?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1826406851/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1826876328", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2187#issuecomment-1826876328", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2187", "id": 1826876328, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5s4-uo", "user": {"login": "c-devine", "id": 28029119, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDI5MTE5", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28029119?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine", "html_url": "https://github.com/c-devine", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-devine/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/c-dev